{
  "name": "Agency OS 02 \u00b7 Lead Radar (enrich, score, route)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead Radar\nCaptures leads from **any website form** (POST JSON to the webhook) or the built-in **n8n form**, then:\n1. Normalizes fields and guesses the website from a business email domain.\n2. Reads the lead's website: title, positioning, and tech stack (GA4, Meta Pixel, HubSpot, Shopify...).\n3. **Brain (revops playbook)** scores fit 0-100, assigns a tier, recommends a service, and drafts a personal opener.\n4. Logs to **Leads**, then routes: \ud83d\udd25 hot -> Slack alert + booking email \u00b7 \ud83c\udf24 warm -> nurture email \u00b7 cold/spam -> archived.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "70177b46-bf5c-4913-89e2-e1358e20a756",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
